<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<score-partwise version="3.0">
  <movement-title>Study in A Minor</movement-title>
  <identification>
    <encoding>
      <software>python-ly 0.9.10</software>
      <encoding-date>2026-05-18</encoding-date>
    </encoding>
    <creator type="composer">Dionisio Aguado</creator>
    <subtitle>An Exercise from Nuevo Metodo para Guittare</subtitle>
    <source>Schonenberger, Paris. Plate S. 1320</source>
    <date>ca. 1846</date>
    <piece>Section 2, Exercise No. 10</piece>
    <mutopiacomposer>AguadoD</mutopiacomposer>
    <mutopiainstrument>Guitar</mutopiainstrument>
    <style>Classical</style>
    <license>Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0</license>
    <maintainer>Glen Larsen</maintainer>
    <maintainerEmail>glenl.glx at gmail dot com</maintainerEmail>
    <moreInfo>This is a very good first position warmup exercise for a beginner. Unlike many exercises it is lyrical and fun to play. The fingerings in the piece are from Aguado (with one correction to measure 15; see lilypond source notes). Devin Ulibarri found this piece at http://carkiv.musikverk.se/www/boije/Boije_0018.pdf on page 60.</moreInfo>
    <footer>Mutopia-2016/07/18-1833</footer>
